            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Needle 0.3.0</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Review Queue:</strong> paste lists, approve each recording, and keep reviewing while downloads continue.</li>
<li><strong>Smarter previews:</strong> full-track scrubbing, intro skipping, and timestamp comparison between candidates.</li>
<li><strong>Library Repair:</strong> fix tags and embed artwork without downloading again, with original-file backups.</li>
<li><strong>Guides in every tab:</strong> click ? for instructions and troubleshooting.</li>
</ul>
<p>This app is unsigned. macOS may require Privacy &amp; Security → Open Anyway after updating. Your music and settings stay on your computer.</p>
<p><a href="https://github.com/icebli/needle/releases/tag/v0.3.0">Full release notes and installation instructions</a></p>]]></description>
